WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
Dreo appeared in every answer.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.560
But Vornado ranked first
in three of four comparisons.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.100
Same shopper.
Same winter home office.

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.360
In the open prompt, ChatGPT,
Claude and Perplexity

5
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.250
led with Dreo.

6
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.210
Gemini led with Vornado.

7
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.580
Ask for a ranking,
and the split flips.

8
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.610
ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity
put Vornado first.

9
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.400
Claude put Dreo first.

10
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.400
Dreo also appeared in all four
under-$100 answers.

11
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.660
The picks varied by
how the assistants weighed

12
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.620
fan noise, warm-up speed
and room coverage.

13
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.980
On November 15, Vornado
took one first place.

14
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.490
On November 27, it took three.

15
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.780
That’s a change across two snapshots.

16
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.340
Check which prompt
generates the mention,

17
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.870
and which earns first place.

18
00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.680
We captured 12 answers.

19
00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.770
We didn’t verify prices
or test product safety.

20
00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.800
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
